# Live Google reviews (optional). Without these the Reviews section shows a "Read/Write a review on Google" card.
# 1. Google Cloud Console → enable "Places API (New)" (billing required)
# 2. Create an API key → restrict it to Places API (New) → set a daily quota cap
# 3. Find the Place ID: https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=
